      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Moderate – A prototype exists, and a print book has been produced. The patent-pending claim is promising, but needs verification. The roadmap is somewhat vague.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Good – The print book sales and app licensing model provide multiple revenue streams. The donation component adds a positive brand association.",
